      "questionId": "qe-c03-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Meaning in life is typically defined by significance, purpose, and coherence.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b2d5ea61239846ccd8ed8d1fdbf0586e3b801654ee6a9363a5c4853c6366b314",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-005",
      "parentFingerprint": "b6edb5a7d8b71288fc099ba57511d720fa2dbfe9cfabe2513baa45a354c4877d",
      "passageSha256": "a4459f4ece21104e179d2f97082735c28f9b79b3473820e829f9653f2d90d89b",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0008",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-s005",
      "sentenceText": "A meaningful life is a life that makes a difference in the world.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6199c090ee869032623f0eb421c40988e4370db803e90d673f008838260a7950",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-006",
      "parentFingerprint": "48a003e3d549d96c045ead90d2ded9f4d237b728a8542ce334c210b363d9a70e",
      "passageSha256": "ebbb582ec044e6f63817e907848ca3a07d341475eef54d79b4b7b67901eb29a6",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0009",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Third, a meaningful life is well organized.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bd0123245a6afaf60fb900a399cbbb778bc92a0cab6ffbe810d91f6b33f5b5f3",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-00750-r009-010",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-007",
      "parentFingerprint": "65cf76be99666c9336e36a411c1cfc793a5f56a2a4885a66b8d604dcf64417da",
      "passageSha256": "5f1bb73f139d5a9c1ad9eb0b0b6d68ce769acfffc189f7f2edb74ae221be93c3",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0010",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In contrast, a meaningless life is a life that does not make any difference in the world.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8aee0b90341c3179f9eccf6e8215d8fdeeabde0e1bfe3dbbe99332d6099be75a",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a9a649e9956f9f334fc0becc2c7cab96e697ec2dcf451520ee6bbfca9f10322",
      "passageSha256": "97da215cdd65aebee7fdd7d0af715899a3f2e4290e418fa0f0fec5b95cc44839",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0011",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Anthropologist David Graeber, in his book Bullshit Jobs: A Theory, argues that there are millions of people around the world who are toiling away their lives in meaningless jobs.",
      "sentenceSha256": "00a89e4ede6a44daa77c9a5d8d0523c5cc0e01ce4f57671baa64900e6e0505ce",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-008",
      "parentFingerprint": "8a9a649e9956f9f334fc0becc2c7cab96e697ec2dcf451520ee6bbfca9f10322",
      "passageSha256": "97da215cdd65aebee7fdd7d0af715899a3f2e4290e418fa0f0fec5b95cc44839",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0012",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Meaningless jobs, according to Graeber, are not just repetitive factory or clerical jobs, but also include corporate lawyers, public relations consultants, telemarketers, and brand managers.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e7d660679fda3eb69fcc8fdc58f31ff6078c3771ab0b1283e89873f863937a5c",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "adac9eebd9d3df9589a3e7fa8d199b579572246a0ee90fd5da20a0f49d6e0215",
      "passageSha256": "01f83b631dfedb25adf53536b34397b6d8f50d0463e2bb33fb4bc5d86b1598e8",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0013",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-s005",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, he claims that most corporate lawyers secretly believe that the world would probably be a better place if they did not exist.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fac0eeddab688d606f4afeafc0fe399ad7579a1c41923fb0838eec5f8f528d22",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-r004-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-009",
      "parentFingerprint": "adac9eebd9d3df9589a3e7fa8d199b579572246a0ee90fd5da20a0f49d6e0215",
      "passageSha256": "01f83b631dfedb25adf53536b34397b6d8f50d0463e2bb33fb4bc5d86b1598e8",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0014",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-s010",
      "sentenceText": "People without a clear purpose tend to go through their lives aimlessly.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9ba9a19ef14c46132c357901a8e3b4e324442c818bbb5147e766156189418c90",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s01-p028-02700-r008-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-010",
      "parentFingerprint": "fba1dc90d0be9e10f6c9651164edd4a7d085885744cf668b6bdb57310c6c1554",
      "passageSha256": "a2d3acb5af01d267eb3476e332dd192b75ff989894a332e1bfb206c6b90bf14f",
      "pdfPages": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0015",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Needless to say, a meaningful life sounds a lot more appealing than a meaningless one.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8f319b25f271c9212c605bca27c5878cb6212956023d3a04827b5e026762bd1a",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "48af98ce1a7668448d0a7ed765632b85dfb273ede32ca374ae52acd429dabfff",
      "passageSha256": "7dfb5e14196c45111ded645107b5aaa0e7559f39028d17fc6f4cf1a86011d80a",
      "pdfPages": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0016",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Many commencement speakers preach along these lines, including Michelle Obama in her speech to CUNY’s class of 2016: “Be great.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7d6e0f7a3efb16f030e49b4be1d8ce4988fa55ff2933150b16603740530ba091",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "48af98ce1a7668448d0a7ed765632b85dfb273ede32ca374ae52acd429dabfff",
      "passageSha256": "7dfb5e14196c45111ded645107b5aaa0e7559f39028d17fc6f4cf1a86011d80a",
      "pdfPages": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0017",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Build great lives for yourselves….",
      "sentenceSha256": "25af381e3e9169e93730751ce780ec77572c67ca83b638a117f67283f62693ac",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p028-06525-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "48af98ce1a7668448d0a7ed765632b85dfb273ede32ca374ae52acd429dabfff",
      "passageSha256": "7dfb5e14196c45111ded645107b5aaa0e7559f39028d17fc6f4cf1a86011d80a",
      "pdfPages": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0018",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-01530-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Dr. Donna Adams-Pickett did exactly what Michele Obama promoted.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2df6901656f7f67934e5ae85e6443ab3f155477f6084a006be3ea5462d07ea61",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-014",
      "parentFingerprint": "afb0e459b5402fa5abe8494c305b51a4bae28dc39490f26921e1bcb7586b9769",
      "passageSha256": "8876360e02a588bef4f70199a76fb63a46d7f9357f3818844e80b47ca5c84b9a",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0019",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-01530-s005",
      "sentenceText": "As she shared with PBS NewsHour, Dr. Adams-Pickett delivered over 6,000 babies over the last twenty years in Augusta, Georgia, an area located in a maternity care desert.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ff9b85ffb494c5e6e5639a6466c2793eaf01d06fcb720b492a7029da6524c422",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-01530-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "d37238a9c355a3824d3d036be46c9c77d39f8509fccc7e189fcc8893b0eebeb6",
      "passageSha256": "9245e82b03f10e9b0b09714a5bba706510371d1d4f6716882b43233a83585253",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0020",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-s001",
      "sentenceText": "When we think of people who live meaningful lives, we might think of those who have done great things, like Dr. Donna Adams-Pickett, Michelle Obama, or Barack Obama—the kind of people who give graduation speeches!",
      "sentenceSha256": "b0935e07f0418c43f411213d81953fb2a790f657c9e5aef638b0dd7643898a27",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "97153c003e2a611a1622b0dc9195956c235520e6a8863874e2d627c5eebbf6ed",
      "passageSha256": "84ed4b68062eba2dd9a40bd0e9071d338874cfd5b50df8aba9eaac45418e9c01",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0021",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-s002",
      "sentenceText": "These are extraordinary achievements.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4ef7d6cf6ebb120fa51a89d2c5ee064453a06fb5760f783ce46884e0ebaf342b",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "97153c003e2a611a1622b0dc9195956c235520e6a8863874e2d627c5eebbf6ed",
      "passageSha256": "84ed4b68062eba2dd9a40bd0e9071d338874cfd5b50df8aba9eaac45418e9c01",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0022",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-s003",
      "sentenceText": "These people are heroes.",
      "sentenceSha256": "80fbe82a0f44fb3eb274a6aa3fac31b3001462c9040db7d36ecd06d068677e00",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "97153c003e2a611a1622b0dc9195956c235520e6a8863874e2d627c5eebbf6ed",
      "passageSha256": "84ed4b68062eba2dd9a40bd0e9071d338874cfd5b50df8aba9eaac45418e9c01",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Like the happiness trap, there is also a meaning trap.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e533b9735b74f081bcf3f583f9afd598f3bd653ef09d3b5547ab4c67994ae2b",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s02-p029-04065-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "dbce266e850660feec272096b79dab7a95cb841f2a7847bdeb1e553e727d3ee5",
      "passageSha256": "180f0fac3381e13c4646598ce71d10505d878ba20d744ab4e7e37b6156827c1c",
      "pdfPages": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s03-p029-06330-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The second element of the meaning trap is that people tend to misunderstand what is required.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7200d5013162368e9344ba0bd0efb748c586a149e2a45c30b9298ecc9f408a08",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s03-p029-06330-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "d74793d6567a21c1b3017f2e51d8f52575f52a3e116b251d909adfd3aa62bd61",
      "passageSha256": "32f129b6f30e7679b8f0a12efc2a19440b936b82642a1e39504b51f111256941",
      "pdfPages": [
        29,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s03-p029-06330-s002",
      "sentenceText": "These images of heroes with supersized ambitions do not necessarily fit with the research findings.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9f5232262947dc796fb79519988a83934337e0968325cac4efe4200838b8ba76",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s03-p029-06330-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "d74793d6567a21c1b3017f2e51d8f52575f52a3e116b251d909adfd3aa62bd61",
      "passageSha256": "32f129b6f30e7679b8f0a12efc2a19440b936b82642a1e39504b51f111256941",
      "pdfPages": [
        29,
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-s001",
      "sentenceText": "How is it possible that we think the meaningful life is for overachieving heroes, yet most people say their lives are meaningful?",
      "sentenceSha256": "fbc6beb8bacf109877c7f74dbeb302b50de97e1a0a99104a22056b30b57b53d1",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "c39545e21c5cf9ea1f43c956f152408e725018dd92492850f849fdfbffbca353",
      "passageSha256": "5906f9814a838ea2def592d456aacfaa56e19682ace6316b5795af483b6b3e2d",
      "pdfPages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-s002",
      "sentenceText": "One answer might lie in how the question about meaning in life was asked.",
      "sentenceSha256": "81f2b66f8afb1b44360dcd0cbd3224e9ff30d645c5742933cd840f9b8271d4c6",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "c39545e21c5cf9ea1f43c956f152408e725018dd92492850f849fdfbffbca353",
      "passageSha256": "5906f9814a838ea2def592d456aacfaa56e19682ace6316b5795af483b6b3e2d",
      "pdfPages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-s005",
      "sentenceText": "To say, “No, my life has no purpose nor meaning,” is almost to say one’s life is pointless.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2618b462cb204e448840b5e30b96727600eb0559c4470dac6be607892805f21c",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s03-p030-01530-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "95708e0f8d3c08e41801e9b78ddcf76448a0cbbd11875117fc94058a371ebe56",
      "passageSha256": "ac8a1733c8d6543877ceb68125ad51a28f3d3a816c35b0f240ae785ebf9decd6",
      "pdfPages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p030-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Still, the fact that 28.5 percent of Americans report having a real purpose in life and another 54.9 percent report having a more or less real purpose is impressive.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5aa03195335104fee3d8e7a3f9491d35b91c023e83f662d4dbb09ab87b08f942",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p030-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "1ec045894d478daa34d5c12ac189b2be5af2741e01595fa79539dd36029b6dd7",
      "passageSha256": "5d3564e48c9e66fe1bf05b5618dd2f76b07d5aac3f614d21f2ebccf7a368fc0d",
      "pdfPages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p030-05160-s004",
      "sentenceText": "It turns out that this is not simply a self-reporting bias.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c37c99be0d48e97bd2f0f760d7aff5e71c2f08c36f22ee9215a45102d3d266a5",
      "readingUnitId": "c03-s04-p030-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c03-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "1ec045894d478daa34d5c12ac189b2be5af2741e01595fa79539dd36029b6dd7",
      "passageSha256": "5d3564e48c9e66fe1bf05b5618dd2f76b07d5aac3f614d21f2ebccf7a368fc0d",
      "pdfPages": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c03-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c03-s04-p030-05160-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Psychologist Michael Steger and colleagues asked participants to report how meaningful they feel their lives are.",
